          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="v-tabs__panel" data-tab-panel="Power &amp; Battery" role="tabpanel" hidden>
          <table class="v-specs-table">
            <tbody>
              {%- assign rows = s1_4wd_50_g2 | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
              {%- for row in rows -%}
                {%- assign r = row | strip -%}
                {%- if r != blank -%}
                  {%- assign kv = r | split: '=' -%}
                  <tr><th>{{ kv | first | escape }}</th><td>{{ kv | last | escape }}</td></tr>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="v-tabs__panel" data-tab-panel="Build &amp; Safety" role="tabpanel" hidden>
          <table class="v-specs-table">
            <tbody>
              {%- assign rows = s1_4wd_50_g3 | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
              {%- for row in rows -%}
                {%- assign r = row | strip -%}
                {%- if r != blank -%}
                  {%- assign kv = r | split: '=' -%}
                  <tr><th>{{ kv | first | escape }}</th><td>{{ kv | last | escape }}</td></tr>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="vpd-more">
      <button type="button" class="v-btn v-btn--ghost" data-request-demo data-message="Hello! I'm interested in getting a quote for the {{ vpd_code }} {{ vpd_name }}. Could you please provide more information?">Learn More About Specifications →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="vpd-section" id="faq" data-reveal>
  <div class="v-container">
    <h2 class="vpd-section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="v-accordion vpd-faq__accordion" data-accordion>
      <div class="v-accordion__item" data-open="false">
        <button type="button" class="v-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-trigger aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What is the difference between the 50° Grip Tread and 40° Wide Wheel editions?</span>
          {%- render 'vesper-icons', icon: 'chevron-down' -%}
        </button>
        <div class="v-accordion__panel">
          <p class="vpd-faq-answer">Both use the same 4-Motor AWD platform, 53 cm deck, and 1985W peak power. The 50° Grip Tread edition uses aggressive tread tires for maximum slope climbing on 50° (119% grade) terrain. The 40° Wide Wheel edition uses wider TPU tires for a larger contact patch — preferred for soft soil, mud, and customers who want extra stability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-accordion__item" data-open="false">
        <button type="button" class="v-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-trigger aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How long does the battery last and what is the maximum mowing area?</span>
          {%- render 'vesper-icons', icon: 'chevron-down' -%}
        </button>
        <div class="v-accordion__panel">
          <p class="vpd-faq-answer">Powered by 56V LiFePO₄ batteries with 1500 cycles — 3× the industry average. The 18Ah battery runs up to 2h 15m and covers up to 4500 ㎡ per charge. The 12Ah runs up to 1h 30m and covers 3000 ㎡. Charging from a 600W charger takes ~90 min (18Ah) and ~70 min (12Ah).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-accordion__item" data-open="false">
        <button type="button" class="v-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-trigger aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What safety features protect the operator and bystanders?</span>
          {%- render 'vesper-icons', icon: 'chevron-down' -%}
        </button>
        <div class="v-accordion__panel">
          <p class="vpd-faq-answer">The S1 has 4 ultrasonic sensors that detect obstacles, people, and pets — slowing or stopping the machine and blades on approach. A front bumper adds an impact buffer. Tilt and roll-over sensors automatically stop the blades if the unit tips beyond a safe angle.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-accordion__item" data-open="false">
        <button type="button" class="v-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-trigger aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Is it controlled only by a remote, and how far does it reach?</span>
          {%- render 'vesper-icons', icon: 'chevron-down' -%}
        </button>
        <div class="v-accordion__panel">
          <p class="vpd-faq-answer">Yes — operated entirely by the included remote control. Signal range reaches up to 400 m. For large areas, one-touch straight-line and one-touch turning functions are available. For safety and visual range, 100 m is the recommended working distance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-accordion__item" data-open="false">
        <button type="button" class="v-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-trigger aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What mowing modes are available?</span>
          {%- render 'vesper-icons', icon: 'chevron-down' -%}
        </button>
        <div class="v-accordion__panel">
          <p class="vpd-faq-answer">Three primary modes: Mulching (cuts clippings into fine fragments that fertilize the lawn), Bagging (collects clippings in a rear bag for easy disposal), and Rear Discharge (expels clippings out the back for quick cleanup). The 4-in-1 add-on adds the leaf-shredding vacuum.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-accordion__item" data-open="false">
        <button type="button" class="v-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-trigger aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What maintenance does the S1 require?</span>
          {%- render 'vesper-icons', icon: 'chevron-down' -%}
        </button>
        <div class="v-accordion__panel">
          <p class="vpd-faq-answer">Routine maintenance is limited to blade replacement and machine cleaning. There is no oil, no spark plugs, no fuel filter. LiFePO₄ batteries need only a top-up charge every 3 months during long-term storage to stay above 70%.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="vpd-more">
      <button type="button" class="v-btn v-btn--ghost" data-request-demo data-message="Hello! I'm interested in getting a quote for the {{ vpd_code }} {{ vpd_name }}. Could you please provide more information?">Learn More →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

